  m_Name: New QR Code Data 16
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SafetyTraining.QRCodeData
  qrCodeID: "Test Modu Se\xE7im Paneli"
  title: "Test Modu Se\xE7im Paneli"
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a19aaadcf7844142a73ce60950ec353, type: 3}
  message: "Test Modu Se\xE7im Paneli, cihaz \xFCzerinde uygulanacak **y\xFCksek
    gerilim test y\xF6nteminin se\xE7ilmesini** sa\u011Flar. Panel \xFCzerinden farkl\u0131
    test modlar\u0131 se\xE7ilerek \xF6l\xE7\xFCm sistemi ilgili teste g\xF6re yap\u0131land\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r.\r\n\r\n-
    **VLF:** Kablo yal\u0131t\u0131m\u0131n\u0131n dayan\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 test
    etmek ve K\u0131smi De\u015Farj (PD) \xF6l\xE7\xFCmleri ger\xE7ekle\u015Ftirmek
    i\xE7in kullan\u0131l\u0131r.\r\n- **Tan Delta:** Kablo yal\u0131t\u0131m\u0131n\u0131n
    dielektrik kay\u0131plar\u0131n\u0131 \xF6l\xE7erek yal\u0131t\u0131m\u0131n
    genel durumunu de\u011Ferlendirmek i\xE7in kullan\u0131l\u0131r.\r\n- **SPG:**
    Kablo ar\u0131zalar\u0131n\u0131n yerini tespit etmeye y\xF6nelik ar\u0131za
    te\u015Fhis testlerinde kullan\u0131l\u0131r.\r\n- **T22:** Kablo ar\u0131zalar\u0131n\u0131n
    yak\u0131lmas\u0131 (fault burning) i\u015Flemlerinde kullan\u0131lan \xF6zel
    test modudur.\r\n\r\nDo\u011Fru test modunun se\xE7ilmesi, yap\u0131lacak \xF6l\xE7\xFCm\xFCn
    g\xFCvenilirli\u011Fi ve test s\xFCrecinin do\u011Fru \u015Fekilde y\xFCr\xFCt\xFClmesi
    a\xE7\u0131s\u0131ndan \xF6nemlidir."
